data: {"item_id":"rs_187660","output_index":0,"sequence_number":229,"summary_index":0,"text":"We need to ensure UI requirements: heading Workboard, textbox labelled \"Project name\", button \"Create project\". Already present. Need visible alert containing text when blank name: we have alert div with role alert and display block; good.\n\nRow must have data-testid=\"project-row\". Already there. Should ensure that row contains name and button \"Open project\". Good.\n\nOpening a project navigates to /projects/\u003cid\u003e, shows its name as heading, and provides a Projects button to return to list. Already done.\n\nPersist across reloads: server uses SQLite DB; good.\n\nHealth endpoint: present.\n\nNow need to ensure that blank name leaves list unchanged and displays visible alert containing \"Project name is required\". Already.\n\nPotential issues: The alert text currently \"Project name is required\". Good.\n\nNeed to ensure that project name trimmed; server does that.\n\nPotential test: they might check that alert is visible via getByRole('alert') with text.\n\nOur alert has role=alert and style display:none when hidden; becomes block when error.\n\nOk.\n\nNow need to run npm start to see if server runs. Check package.json.","type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done"}

